\p{All on the private build of the patched copy of the main tree of 22:46 UTC, through its own launchers and with the scripts and the manifest of that copy, without any \code{-X} option unless the row says so. In that tree a rejection of the machine is final by default and the reference engine decides only what the machine declines, so the launcher rows are verdicts of the machine alone except for declined units.}

